OL,3,GNEWSAUnison members vote to reject     
OL,4,Acouncil's new pay structure            
OL,6,FMembers of the union Unison have voted 
OL,7,Fto reject a controversial new pay      
OL,8,Fstructure proposed by Glasgow City     
OL,9,FCouncil.                               
OL,11,FThe trade union, which is the largest  
OL,12,Frepresenting workers at the local      
OL,13,Fauthority, said members want more money
OL,14,Ffor lower-paid staff when the pay      
OL,15,Fstructure is overhauled.               
OL,17,FThe council says it must bring in a new
OL,18,Fpay and grading structure to deal with 
OL,19,Funderlying issues which led to         
OL,20,Fthousands of equal pay claims from     
OL,21,Ffemale workers past and present.       
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
