OL,3,GNEWSAUnison members vote to reject     
OL,4,Acouncil's new pay structure            
OL,6,FEarlier this year, the SNP-led council 
OL,7,Fbacked down on a threat to sack        
OL,8,Fthousands of members of staff and then 
OL,9,Frehire them on new contracts after     
OL,10,Fnegotiations with unions over the      
OL,11,Fproposals broke down.                  
